 "identification_note": "Observational: the production recommender chose the impressions, so click probabilities are conditional on that selection; feature effects are associations.",
 "extrapolation_limits": "MIND-small: 50,000 sampled Microsoft News users (US, English), impressions 2019-11-09..15 chosen by the production recommender. The simulator may use this model for the probability that an individual opens an article shown in a slate, given the cosine of the article's text and its consumption history in the shared MiniLM-L6 space, its category share, popularity per active individual, age and slate size. It may NOT infer: (1) clicks on video or social posts (content_open); (2) other populations, languages or periods; (3) the causal effect of showing an item (no randomised exposure); (4) dwell or reading time; (5) affinities from other encoders or projections that do not preserve MiniLM cosines. Licence: Microsoft Research terms, non-commercial; acquisition route unresolved (BLOCKERS B-1).",
